# verify-work (always on)

Follow the installed `verify-work` skill.

**Project contract:** keep the living acceptance/evidence table in sync (copy from the skill templates, then customize):

- `{{path-to-acceptance-evidence}}`

**Applies to every layer** your stack has (UI, backend, HTTP, DB, email, packages, infra). Optional merge-review agents are not a substitute for proof on the implementing turn.

## Principle

Concrete evidence that the change works — not a description of how it should work. Static checks are prerequisites, not proof, when a runtime path exists.

## Gaps

Cannot get proof → name the gap → strengthen the acceptance table same turn. Do not write gaps off or leave new evidence classes only in chat.
